					"content": "太可惜了，只差一点点。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750300702
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿科米蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 750300702,
					"content": "加油啊，千万不要放弃！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750300703,
						750300706
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿科米蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 750300703,
					"content": "怎么变得这么积极？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750300704
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750300704,
					"content": "我能不能解脱就靠你了，当然要积极面对。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750300705
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿科米蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 750300705,
					"content": "来，歇一会儿我们再试一次，这次一定行。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750300708
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿科米蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 750300708,
					"content": "你放心，我不会放弃你的。不管尝试多少次都行，不要丧失信心，你一定能做到的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750300709
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿科米蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 750300709,
					"content": "赶快给我放弃！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750300710
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750300710,
					"content": "不，我说什么也不会放弃你的。我是没办法加油了，但是你可以。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750300711
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿科米蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 750300711,
					"content": "要是你也帮不上忙，我就真的没有招了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "阿科米蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 750300706,
					"content": "我想休息一会儿。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750300707
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750300707,
					"content": "没关系，你好好休息，待会儿我们再来！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750300708
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿科米蒂"
				}
			]
